# Synthetic registry map for the host tests. Same format as the real
# /usr/share/sensord/sns_reg.map (tools/sns-reg-map.py), invented IDs and
# offsets; the matching data file is made by `fake_smgr mkreg FILE 1024`
# (byte i = i*7+3, zero in group 2980), never taken from a device. Group
# 2980 and items 3900..3905 mirror the real layout of the magnetometer
# calibration group (items 3903..3905: the learned bias), which sensord
# looks up by ID; their offsets here are invented.
size 1024
group 1000 0 16
group 2695 256 40
group 10007 512 34
group 2980 768 126
item 700 0 1
item 701 1 1
item 702 2 1
item 2302 260 8
item 2309 290 2
item 2310 292 1
item 10700 512 4
item 3900 768 4
item 3901 772 1
item 3902 773 1
item 3903 774 4
item 3904 778 4
item 3905 782 4
